# offline-app (content data, DB schema and the APK build scripts) lives in a
# separate PRIVATE repo: https://github.com/YohannesMamo/MenenSoft-Offline
# Clone it back into this path to run the APK builds. It is intentionally
# untracked here so its content never ships in this public repository again.
offline-app/

